":"第16スライド"},{"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","id":"C1D90902-A8EE-4AC0-AF1B-B193DB6C34AB","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_017_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","transitionName":"なし","telop":"「そうしようかな…」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":4.759478458049887,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/1話目_66104b0c58\/1話目_66104b0c58.017.jpeg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 17","slideTitle":"第17スライド"},{"characterName":"操夢","id":"0DDDBFBA-F776-4743-9719-A6E24AEF02B2","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_018_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","telop":"「わかりました、それでは僕は先に、向こうで待ってますね。」","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/東方惑情録　第2話\/nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","voiceDuration":3.1256462585034015,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/1話目_66104b0c58\/1話目_66104b0c58.018.jpeg","backgroundName":"nc73538_【背景素材】博麗神社.jpg","title":"シーン 18","slideTitle":"第18スライド"},{"characterName":"操夢","id":"BAB9201B-7214-4090-8C16-B4324116ABCD","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_019_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","duration":5.9,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","telop":"僕は、リビングに来ると、キッチンに向かい、冷凍庫から冷凍ご飯を出すと、レンジにかけ、その間に醤油とお椀を２つ取り出す。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","voiceDuration":2.2158503401360545,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/1話目_66104b0c58\/1話目_66104b0c58.019.jpeg","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 19","slideTitle":"第19スライド"},{"characterName":"操夢","id":"FF948611-E03A-4F41-8E21-15EAF536BB80","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_020_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","duration":5.4,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","telop":"そして、レンチンが終わると、ご飯をお椀に入れ、冷蔵庫から卵を取り出し、卵を割って、ご飯に乗せ、醤油をかける。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","voiceDuration":4.659342403628118,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/1話目_66104b0c58\/1話目_66104b0c58.020.jpeg","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 20","slideTitle":"第20スライド"},{"characterName":"操夢","id":"502844A2-7007-40F7-8E62-9DCDD1A1135D","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_021_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","telop":"そして、出来上がった卵かけご飯をテーブルに置くと、箸を取り出し、乗せる。そこまで終わると、ちょうどよく彼女も来た。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","voiceDuration":2.22891156462585,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/1話目_66104b0c58\/1話目_66104b0c58.021.jpeg","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 21","slideTitle":"第21スライド"},{"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","id":"F8EF671A-2468-4C36-AEBB-B0C8CC451A27","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_022_フランドール・スカーレット.wav","animationName":"なし","duration":4.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","transitionName":"なし","telop":"私がリビングに来ると、すでに食卓には朝食があった。\n「…朝ごはん…作ってくれてありがとう…」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","voiceDuration":4.086984126984127,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/1話目_66104b0c58\/1話目_66104b0c58.022.jpeg","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 22","slideTitle":"第22スライド"},{"characterName":"操夢","id":"ED857165-D596-4FD2-924F-C8F58D105430","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_023_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","duration":5.800000000000001,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","telop":"彼女の言葉にニコッと笑みを僕は返し、挨拶を済ませて、卵かけご飯を体内に放り込み始める。それは、５分少々で終わった。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","voiceDuration":9.469115646258503,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/1話目_66104b0c58\/1話目_66104b0c58.023.jpeg","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 23","slideTitle":"第23スライド"},{"characterName":"操夢","id":"769999E2-DFCA-44B0-B479-25C5CF5BA096","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_024_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","duration":5.7,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","telop":"そして、フランのお椀を見ると、彼女も食べきっているようで、僕はお椀と箸を全てキッチンのシンクに入れ、洗い物をする。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","voiceDuration":10.518027210884354,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/1話目_66104b0c58\/1話目_66104b0c58.024.jpeg","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 24","slideTitle":"第24スライド"},{"characterName":"フランドール・スカーレット","id":"9FF03326-4448-4085-A057-A2ED95894245","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_025_古明地さとり.wav","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_%E3%83%95%E3%83%A9%E3%83%B3%E3%83%89%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AB%E3%83%BB%E3%82%B9%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%AC%E3%83%83%E3%83%88","transitionName":"なし","telop":"「ねぇ、昨晩…私は何を君にしたの…？」","voiceCharacter":"フランドール・スカーレット","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","voiceDuration":2.861995464852608,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/1話目_66104b0c58\/1話目_66104b0c58.025.jpeg","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 25","slideTitle":"第25スライド"},{"characterName":"操夢","id":"61DA9099-BF57-4E61-A8E9-51D6EBCB3F62","voiceAudioPath":"\/Users\/zuyasi\/Library\/Application Support\/TohoStudio\/GeneratedAudio\/Slide_026_操夢.wav","animationName":"なし","duration":3.5,"audioTrack":"track_voice_soumu","transitionName":"なし","telop":"「知りたいですか…？」\n僕はそう洗い物をしながら、尋ねる。","voiceCharacter":"操夢","backgroundImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_extracted\/交換夫婦（21.22話目）\/nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","voiceDuration":2.559342403628118,"bgmName":"BGM: 東方妖恋談","slideImagePath":"\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/1話目_66104b0c58\/1話目_66104b0c58.026.jpeg","backgroundName":"nc268704_リビング２（日中）.jpg","title":"シーン 26","slideTitle":"第26スライド"},{"characterName":"フラ